        "titolo_orig": "Singapore’s Shanmugam on deported blogger Amos Yee: ‘I wish the Americans had kept him’",
        "testo_it": "Il ministro di Singapore Shanmugam critica la gestione USA del caso del blogger Amos Yee.",
